John Collingwood, played by Tony Goldwyn.

5
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:38,500
Emma Collingwood, played by Monica Potter.

6
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:21,000
Mari Collingwood, played by Sara Paxton.

7
